title: "Automatos AI"
abstract: >
  Automatos AI is a multi-tenant SaaS platform for building and deploying
  autonomous AI agents. It provides multi-agent orchestration with agents,
  skills, playbooks, missions, a marketplace, semantic field memory and
  EU AI Act compliance posture.
